Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Introduction", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"7c1bd846-a82e-405d-a4d6-a893bcc47acb"],

Cell["\<\
The Signals`Bruker` package (SpinDynamica/Signals/Bruker.m) brings \
experimental Bruker TopSpin 1D processed spectra directly into SpinDynamica \
without external conversion tools or hidden normalization.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fe54a8bc-33dd-4f95-85e5-7a2d0f5eddd9"],

Cell["\<\
Import from an experiment root, a pdata directory, a specific pdata/<n> \
directory, or a direct 1r file path.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"5fbc1d80-23d1-499b-a998-52a5df99a3d6"],

Cell["\<\
Preserve Bruker 2^NC_proc physical scaling (IntensityScaling -> \"Bruker\") \
alongside packed RawReal / RawImaginary arrays.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"d03849f4-c112-4c34-9f15-7fdc13189a19"],

Cell["\<\
Plot spectra on SpinDynamica/NMR conventions via PlotBrukerSpectrum or \
ListPlot, apply zero-order phase rotations, and convert spectra back into \
time-domain Signal objects via ToSignal.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ada03f29-abe2-447b-9f3a-423182686229"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Mathematical Background", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"973b002a-c27f-4d67-ab53-2850336a7ec8"],

Cell["\<\
Authoritative TopSpin processing status parameters are read strictly from \
procs (not queued proc): DTYPP selects 32-bit signed integers (0) or 64-bit \
IEEE floats (2), BYTORDP selects little-endian (0) or big-endian (1), and \
Npts equals STSI if STSI > 0 else SI. Stored integers or floats y_raw[k] map \
to physical intensity y_phys[k] = y_raw[k] * 2^NC_proc. With OFFSET giving \
the first-point chemical shift, SW_p the processed spectral width in Hz, and \
SF the spectrometer reference frequency in MHz, point k has chemical shift \
delta_k = OFFSET - (k/(Npts - 1)) * (SW_p / SF), frequency nu_k = delta_k * \
SF, and angular frequency omega_k = 2 Pi nu_k (reversed when REVERSE = yes).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"84e7ed97-0a6b-4190-a182-77353fe0cdef"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Worked Example", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"fc9f2fa3-8dc8-4934-bfa3-395b1a1bf541"],

Cell["\<\
Load sample_data, compare scaling modes, inspect acquisition and processing \
metadata, locate the dominant resonance peak, plot both ppm and zoomed Hz \
views, apply a phase rotation, and verify a ToSignal -> FT round-trip to < \
1e-13 relative error.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"74cbd19d-1102-4398-9ec2-e369866b7c5f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sampleDir", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"nbRepoRoot", ",", " ", "\"\<sample_data\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
