Cell["Suggested Experiments", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"ed5865a1-f553-4433-9d9e-ba7465af45bc"],

Cell["\<\
1. Phase alignment: Drag Zero-Order Phase (deg) in Lab S1A away from 0 deg \
and observe dispersive mixing, then switch Component to \"Magnitude\" to \
verify phase invariance.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"d102fd83-feee-4fa5-ae46-8523d8cd9eaa"],

Cell["\<\
2. Physical frequency check: Switch Axis Units between \"ppm\" (descending \
NMR convention) and \"Hz\" / \"rad/s\" (ascending) and confirm the dominant \
resonance at -1.99 ppm corresponds to -597.7 Hz at SF = 299.83 MHz.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"d3c34186-4a4a-4f9d-b86e-51bb92e584d3"],

Cell["\<\
3. Binary portability: In Lab S1B, switch DTYPP = 2 (Real64) and Byte \
Ordering = 1 (Big-Endian) and confirm Max Real/Imag Error stays near machine \
precision (~0 to 1e-13).\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"a211dd03-18f9-4149-adf3-7c02ca93055b"],

Cell["\<\
4. Strip transform & REVERSE: Compare STSI = 32 against 64 and toggle REVERSE \
to verify exact axis truncation and direction reversal.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"1f4675da-5d8b-47c0-a615-59c368564d8d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Summary", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8d3f3225-ec90-418c-9d0b-012d984c403f"],

Cell["\<\
Signals`Bruker` cleanly bridges TopSpin experimental 1D data and SpinDynamica \
simulation/signal workflows with exact binary fidelity, physical units, \
packed-array efficiency, and lossless ToSignal -> FT round-trips.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8a2aebfe-852c-45e8-8d27-cf8b77150d46"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "See also ",
 StyleBox[ButtonBox["00_GeneralOptimization_Tutorials_Index.nb",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  Evaluator->Automatic,
  Method->"Preemptive",
  ButtonFunction:>NotebookOpen[
    FileNameJoin[{
      ParentDirectory[
       ParentDirectory[
        NotebookDirectory[]]], "Optimization", "Notebooks", 
      "00_GeneralOptimization_Tutorials_Index.nb"}]]], "Hyperlink"],
 " or run Examples/Signals/Tutorial_Bruker1DImport.wls and \
documentation/Signals/Bruker_Data_Import_Guide.md."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"04929485-831e-414e-804d-f9d33f36c01f"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
},
